  {"question": "Stress qanday atama?", "answers": ["stress (ing.stress-bosim, tazyiq,, zo\u2019riqish, tabiiy asabiy tus olish)-turli ekstremal ta\u2019sirlarga javoban qo\u2019zg\u2019aladigan, inson ahvoli (holati)ni atroflicha anglatish uchun qo\u2019llanadigan atama", "stress (ing.stress-bosim, tazyiq,, zo\u2019riqish, g\u2019ayritabiiy asabiy tus olish)-turli ekstremal ta\u2019sirlarga javoban qo\u2019zg\u2019aladigan, inson ahvoli (holati)ni atroflicha anglatish uchun qo\u2019llanadigan atama", "stress (ing.stress-bosim, tazyiq,, zo\u2019riqish, tabiiy asabiy tus olish)-turli ekstremistlar ta\u2019sirlarga javoban qo\u2019zg\u2019aladigan, inson ahvoli (holati)ni atroflicha anglatish uchun qo\u2019llanadigan atama", "stress (ing.stress-bosim, tazyiq,, zo\u2019riqish, tabiiy asabiy tus olish)-turli ekstremal (mustasno) ta\u2019sirlarga javoban qo\u2019zg\u2019aladigan, inson ahvoli (holati)ni atroflicha anglatish uchun qo\u2019llanadigan atama"], "correct": 1},
